      "message": "To be clear, if VPNs indeed don\u0027t exhibit the behaviour or need exemption for a reason I think it would be important to know why at least in the commit message if not here in a code comment. If so, I\u0027d like to inspect why and see if there needs to be alignment in behaviour or if the exception is reasonable",
